## Quick Start

Use the `subagent` tool to spawn isolated sub-agents.

### Single
```json
{
  "agent": "agent-name",
  "task": "Your task description"
}
```

### Parallel
```json
{
  "tasks": [
    {"agent": "frontend-developer", "task": "Audit the signup UI flow"},
    {"agent": "backend-developer", "task": "Audit the signup API flow"}
  ]
}
```

### Chain
```json
{
  "chain": [
    {"agent": "code-explorer", "task": "Trace how auth currently works in this repo"},
    {"agent": "code-architect", "task": "Design the new auth feature based on {previous}"},
    {"agent": "backend-developer", "task": "Implement the plan based on {previous}"}
  ]
}
```

