### Best practice
- Prefer the agent's default model.
- In this setup, the standard default for subagents is **MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5**.
- Only override the model when you have a concrete reason.
- Do not use shorthand names.

### Recommended family split for implementation workflows
- `MiniMaxAI/MiniMax-M2.5`: implementation and simplicity passes
- `moonshotai/Kimi-K2.5`: integration and codebase-recall review
- `zai-org/GLM-5`: validation and operability review
