## Agent Definition Files

Agent configs live in:
```text
~/.pi/agent/agents/*.md
```

Project-specific agents can also live in:
```text
.pi/agents/*.md
```

Each file may contain:
- `name`
- `description`
- `model`
- `tools`
- `thinking`
- `skill` / `skills`
- `output`
- `defaultReads`
- `defaultProgress`
- `extensions`
- a markdown system prompt body

To inspect an agent:
```json
{"action": "get", "agent": "debugger"}
```

